    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59cd355224ab3ae58aeee370",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在立刻想办法扭转吧！为了趣味性，\n我甚至做好了流着血泪也愿意输掉的觉悟……。\n可明明获胜的才叫主人公……！？　咕啊ーー！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "42837ef884fe6d9a685c3b6b94d5bcbe39e7dbab3893a8f2dc64589dc09cdb4c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
