      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，在混乱状态尚未解除之际，\n神业面对她的平板电脑开始了沉思。\n而她的下一场预定比赛是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfb1bf5fd84d4763ee6bb1718d888bb4a2c45c5d22d8305e116d67dae2d798ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
