      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自那之后，神业的干劲有些过度，\n与她的意见协调也变得异常困难。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7604af6d7af02434e0c9ca08a3a93fedd5e20a6e30d330a3a4fcc46a5b6bc14b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
